<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 10.3 percent in year to October.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 10.3 percent in year to October.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following final data on UK monetary aggregates for October:</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY		     OCT    (PREL OCT)     SEPT</p>
<p>    M4 in month     (adjusted)  +1.1    (+1.1)	   +0.8</p>
<p>    M4 year to date (adjusted) +10.3    (+10.3)	  +9.9</p>
<p>    M4 in month     (unadj)     +0.9    (+0.9)	   +0.8</p>
<p>    M4 year to date (unadj)    +10.3    (+10.3)	  +9.8</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks,</p>
<p>    b/societies (bln stg)	  7.0     7.4		3.7</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
